{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","戴蒙"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长使用护盾的坦克，擅长借取敌方的生命保护自己和友军。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我已经长大了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I'm all grown up now!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我们变强了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","We've become stronger!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","奇奇会保护我们的。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Stitchy will protect us."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","比生病还疼……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","This hurts more than being sick..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","奇奇，胜利了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Yay, Stitchy, we won!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","你会一直陪着我吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Will you stay with me forever?"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","奇奇，出来和我一起玩吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Stitchy... Come play with me."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我们在这里多待一会儿吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Let's stay here a little longer, okay?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好特别的礼物……真的要送给我吗？谢谢你！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","除了爸爸妈妈外，你是唯一一个会送我礼物的人。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","凋零之殇"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","早殇的男孩，深眠的晚安曲。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","雪中童趣"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","打雪仗、堆雪人，他终于能肆意奔跑，享受冬日的快乐。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","奇奇，这里好热闹"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","爸爸妈妈去哪里了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我能尝尝这个吗？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","生前，戴蒙总是因为病弱而备受欺凌。没有小朋友愿意和生病的戴蒙一起玩，有些恶霸孩子甚至会一边嘲笑他，一边朝他丢石头。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","戴蒙的妈妈雪米拉怕戴蒙孤单，为他缝制了一个玩偶做他的玩伴。玩偶的棉花手臂曾被恶霸孩子扯断过，但经过雪米拉的巧手修复，又恢复了原样。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","戴蒙给玩偶起名叫斯蒂奇，不过他更喜欢叫它“奇奇”。戴蒙将奇奇看做是自己唯一的朋友，对着它说了不少小秘密。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","戴蒙的父亲尼汝总是很忙，很少回家，对戴蒙也疏于照顾，但戴蒙从未怨恨过父亲。病中的他躺在病床上，满心期待着爸爸回来的那一天。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","9岁的戴蒙把生日愿望写在了一张纸条上，他希望自己的病能痊愈。但后来病情渐重，他意识到这个愿望不可能实现，就偷偷改成了想让爸爸多回家。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","戴蒙的房间里有一面墙，上面贴满了他画的一家三口的简笔画，什么情景都有，一起玩木马、跷跷板、放风筝、堆雪人……虽然画工稚嫩，但每一幅都画得很认真。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","雪米拉曾在戴蒙的枕头下发现一本自制的“医学笔记”，里面歪歪扭扭地记录着他观察到的“症状”：奇奇的失眠症、云朵的感冒、歪脖子树的颈椎病、甚至邻家咳嗽的老猫。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","有个秘密只有奇奇知道：戴蒙把父亲的一封信藏在了它的肚子里。这封信上写着“我很快就回来”，但墨水已经被眼泪浸得模糊不清。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在戴蒙和雪米拉都成为亡灵之后，雪米拉用亡灵法术活化了玩偶奇奇，这样它就能一直陪着戴蒙，做他最忠诚、最可靠的伙伴和护卫。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","戴蒙死前曾在心里许愿，他想要一家人团聚，和爸爸妈妈还有奇奇永远幸福生活在一起。现在，他的愿望实现了。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","妈妈，奇奇说想出去玩，我能一起去吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415668.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","戴蒙 & 雪米拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","奇奇，这里好热闹"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415679.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","戴蒙"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我能尝尝这个吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415680.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","戴蒙"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415735.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","皮帕 & 戴蒙"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","你手上拿着的是……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415762.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","格温妮丝 & 戴蒙"]]}